  "job_C11.2_20251003_115131": {
    "chunk_text": "indon drihten Benedicite aque omnes quae super caelos sunt Bletsige e\u00e6ll m\u00e6gen drihtnes drihten benedicite omnes virtutes domini domino. Bletsige sunne & mon\u00e6 drihten Benedicite sol et luna domino. Bletsige stiorr\u00e6n hefon\u00e6s drihten benedicite stelle caeli domino. Bletsige scur\u00e6 & de\u00e6wung drihten Benedicite ymber et ros domino. Bletsige e\u00e6lle g\u00e6st\u00e6s benedicite omnis spiritus dei domino. & heto drihten Benedicite ignis et estus domino. Bletsige ciele & het\u00e6 drihten benedicite frigus et estas domino. Bletsige & hrim drihten Benedicite rores et pruina domino. Bletsige & ciele drihten benedicite gelu et frigus domino. Bletsige sn\u00e6w drihten Benedicite glacies et nives domino. Bletsige niht\u00e6 & d\u00e6g\u00e6s drihten benedicite noctes et dies domino. Bletsige & \u00feiestro drihten Benedicite lux et tenebrae domino. Bletsige ligetu & wolcn drihten benedicite fulgura et nubes domino. Eor\u00f0\u00e6 drihten her\u00e6\u00fe & ofer him on world Benedicat terra dominum laudet et superexaltet eum in Bletsige muntes & hill\u00e6 drihten Benedicite montes et colles domino. Bletsige ealle upspringende on eor\u00f0\u00e6 drihten benedicite universa germinantia in terra domino. Bletsige wyll\u00e6n drihten Benedicite fontes domino. Bletsige se & stre\u00e6m\u00e6s drihten benedicite maria et flumina domino. Bletsige hwel\u00e6s & e\u00e6lle \u00f0\u00e6 beo\u00f0 weonde on wetere drihten Benedicite caete et omnia quae Bletsige e\u00e6lle fugl\u00e6s hefon\u00e6",
